# This is a Windows-only Visual Studio project (C++/CLI + WinForms) —
# normalize everything to CRLF instead of the LF-first convention used
# elsewhere in this course's tooling, since that's what Visual Studio
# and MSBuild produce and expect natively on this stack.
* text=auto eol=crlf

# Datasets and binary assets — never let git touch line endings on these
*.csv binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
